    "detailed_description": "Input-based free-kick football game. No randomness, no scripting, only pure skill. <br>Score as many freekicks as you can while the AI goalkeeper and defenders try their best to stop you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INPUT-BASED BALL TRAJECTORY</h2><br> Strike the ball at the correct position, and direction, with just enough power (and curve if necessary) to score. The ball trajectory is fully defined by your input only.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/91fdd03fcee3cd91d45d5eaa56464c74.poster.avif?t=1755321553\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/91fdd03fcee3cd91d45d5eaa56464c74.webm?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/91fdd03fcee3cd91d45d5eaa56464c74.mp4?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intelligent AI goalkeepers and defenders.</h2><br>Your opponents will do the best they can to stop you from scoring. When you shoot, they will assert the trajectory to decide where, when, and how to intercept.<br>The goalkeeper moves to a good position before reaching for the ball just in time to stop a goal:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/052980207f37be0fa396973dc6cdd672.poster.avif?t=1755321553\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/052980207f37be0fa396973dc6cdd672.webm?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/052980207f37be0fa396973dc6cdd672.mp4?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A big stadium with thousands of fans cheering.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/5008d99a130b360e8b69102de53ea2fd.avif?t=1755321553\" width=768 height=396 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >32 national teams' football kits.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic goal-net physics.</h2><br>The net will react realistically to the ball.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/227c867949bd73496635c0acc0586dd7.avif?t=1755321553\" width=742 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with your friends and other players on Steam Leaderboards.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "Input-based free-kick football game. No randomness, no scripting, only pure skill. <br>Score as many freekicks as you can while the AI goalkeeper and defenders try their best to stop you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INPUT-BASED BALL TRAJECTORY</h2><br> Strike the ball at the correct position, and direction, with just enough power (and curve if necessary) to score. The ball trajectory is fully defined by your input only.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/91fdd03fcee3cd91d45d5eaa56464c74.poster.avif?t=1755321553\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/91fdd03fcee3cd91d45d5eaa56464c74.webm?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/91fdd03fcee3cd91d45d5eaa56464c74.mp4?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intelligent AI goalkeepers and defenders.</h2><br>Your opponents will do the best they can to stop you from scoring. When you shoot, they will assert the trajectory to decide where, when, and how to intercept.<br>The goalkeeper moves to a good position before reaching for the ball just in time to stop a goal:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/052980207f37be0fa396973dc6cdd672.poster.avif?t=1755321553\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/052980207f37be0fa396973dc6cdd672.webm?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/052980207f37be0fa396973dc6cdd672.mp4?t=1755321553\" type=\"video/mp4\